---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import ServiceCard from '../../components/ServiceCard.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base title="Services — psiberAI" description="PQC migration, ISO 27001, and ISO 42001 — vendor-neutral security and AI-governance advisory for regulated enterprises.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Services"
    title="Security you can prove, not just assert."
    lead="Three service lines, one principle: independent, standards-led work that produces evidence your board and your auditors accept. We don't resell products, so the recommendation is always yours."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <ServiceCard
          href="/services/pqc-migration"
          name="PQC Migration"
          tag="Post-quantum cryptography"
          featured={true}
          blurb="Find your quantum-vulnerable cryptography and get a phased migration roadmap — before 'harvest-now, decrypt-later' becomes 'decrypted.'"
        />
        <ServiceCard
          href="/services/iso-27001"
          name="ISO 27001"
          tag="Information security"
          blurb="Build or mature an ISMS that passes audit and reflects how you actually operate — not a binder no one reads."
        />
        <ServiceCard
          href="/services/iso-42001"
          name="ISO 42001"
          tag="AI management"
          blurb="Stand up governance for your AI systems against the emerging AI-management standard, mapped to your real use cases."
        />
      </div>

      <div class="services-note prose" style="margin-top:40px">
        <p>
          <strong>Where to start:</strong> most engagements begin with the
          <a href="/services/pqc-migration">PQC Migration Readiness Assessment</a> — a fixed-scope,
          fixed-price piece of work that produces a concrete artifact and, usually, the roadmap for
          everything that follows. The cryptographic inventory it delivers also feeds directly into
          ISO 27001 cryptography controls, so the lines reinforce each other.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta />
</Base>
